  "seo": {
    "metatags": {
      "og:site_name": "BuzzKit documentation"
    }
  },
  "markdown": {
    "instructions": "BuzzKit is an open source notification orchestration layer. Send mobile push from a backend with one POST to /v1/messages, targeting a subscriber id, a topic, a saved segment or an inline expression. Subscribers are addressed by the caller's own user ids. Authenticate with a bearer API key from the dashboard; workspace keys pick a tenant with the BuzzKit-Tenant header. Every response is the envelope { success, data, error, metadata } and errors carry a stable snake_case code. iOS is the supported client SDK. The machine-readable API description is at https://buzzkit.dev/openapi.json."
  }
}
